Rule 1 (input tensor must be >= 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 2 (output tensor must be >= 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 8 (output tensor must be same type as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 9 (input tensor must have compatible shapes with output)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor must be >= 1-dimensional and have positive dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
